    },
    "A complete archive of the C64 era's SID music, kept alive by a volunteer crew of SID archeologists." : {

    },
    "A green monochrome screen" : {

    },
    "A link names a tune in HVSC, so the other person gets it from their own collection. Your own SID files can't be shared this way." : {

    },
    "A medley" : {

    },
    "A player for Commodore 64 music." : {

    },
    "A remote control for Resonance, for your shell and your scripts." : {

    },
    "A shared tune" : {

    },
    "A SID tune is a little C64 program, so there's nothing to jump to: to reach a point, Resonance runs the tune there silently at full speed, about a second per minute of tune on reSIDfp and faster on SIDLite direct. The bar shows the new position right away; the sound follows." : {

