    "Click **+** next to Playlists in the sidebar to make one, and type its name." : {

    },
    "Click **Copy Command** there." : {

    },
    "Click **Drift From Here** on the Sounds Like card, or choose **Drift From This Tune** on the Dock icon, for a radio that doesn't end: each tune sounds like the one before, so it slowly wanders across the collection. It stops when you play something else." : {

    },
    "Click **Retry** in the message at the top of the window. A download that was canceled starts over from Download next to Collection." : {

    },
    "Click a column header to sort, and **Back to Original Order** above the list to undo it. Control-click the header to choose which columns show." : {

    },
    "Click a match to show it in the library, or click **Play These** to play them all, most alike first." : {

    },
    "Click Resonance's icon in the menu bar, or press **⌃⌥⌘P** in any app, for a small player: the tune and its voices, the heart, the controls with Shuffle and Repeat, the next tunes in the list it plays from (click one to play it), Surprise Me and Add to…. Turn Surprise Me off there and Resonance goes back to the list you were playing." : {

    },
    "Click the heart in the inspector or Now Playing to make a tune a favorite, and again to undo it. Favorites keep the order you hearted them in." : {

