    },
    "If Resonance is in the background when a download or a long scan ends, or a download fails, it sends a notification. Clicking a download's opens the HVSC Home, and a failed one also offers Retry. Resonance asks for permission the first time; change your mind in System Settings → Notifications." : {

    },
    "If your collection is older and doesn't have it, Resonance offers the HVSC update. With no collection yet, it offers the download. The download continues if you close the sheet; open the link again when it's done." : {

