    },
    "In the library, the floating bar plays, pauses and skips, shows the progress through the tune, and has Shuffle, Repeat and the volume. Drag or click the progress bar to scrub. Tunes with more than one song step through them with the arrows next to the progress bar." : {

    },
    "In the sidebar, under HVSC, click **Download** next to **Collection**. Resonance fetches the newest HVSC release from an HVSC mirror and unpacks it into its own folder." : {

