    "Sounds Like Is Ready" : {

    },
    "Sounds Like now covers your whole collection." : {

    },
    "Sounds Like says a tune isn't fingerprinted" : {

    },
    "Sounds Like, the Fingerprint column and the Sound filters need each tune's fingerprint. The first time, Resonance downloads the published fingerprint set (about 42 MB) and audio embeddings (about 11 MB), which cover all of HVSC, and a background scan fills in whatever it doesn't have. A full scan of your own takes a few hours; with the published set it's mostly done in a minute." : {

