    },
    "The folder that holds MUSICIANS, GAMES and DEMOS. Updating adds the new and changed tunes; tunes a release moves or removes stay where they were. Downloading again restores missing or damaged files." : {

    },
    "The folder that holds MUSICIANS, GAMES and DEMOS. With nothing in it yet, download the collection into it — by default Resonance's own folder." : {

    },
    "The Help menu brings back the welcome steps with **Welcome to Resonance**. It also has **Keyboard Shortcuts** and the **Credits**, with a nod to the demoscene." : {

    },
    "The High Voltage SID Collection — every well-kept C64 SID in one complete, documented archive. Download it to browse by composer, search, and play." : {

    },
    "The High Voltage SID Collection holds more than 60,000 tunes, organized by composer and documented by volunteers since 1996." : {

